WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:01.460
NARRATOR: Gotham City,

00:00:01.543 --> 00:00:05.297
a cauldron of crime
and corruption
about to boil over.

00:00:05.464 --> 00:00:07.007
BATMAN:
I'm trying to save the city.

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:07.966
CATWOMAN: So am I.

00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:10.052
I just get paid for it
better than you do.

00:00:10.177 --> 00:00:13.931
NARRATOR:
A new nightmare whispers
from the edges of sanity.

00:00:14.139 --> 00:00:15.516
SCARECROW:
This is the Scarecrow.

00:00:15.599 --> 00:00:17.017
I'm in your head!

00:00:17.226 --> 00:00:19.311
Don't you remember?
You're fighting me.

00:00:19.394 --> 00:00:23.482
NARRATOR:
A criminal mastermind makes
a play for total control.

00:00:23.565 --> 00:00:25.234
JOKER:
There is a terrible corruption

00:00:25.317 --> 00:00:29.738
at the heart of the Gotham City
Police Department,

00:00:29.947 --> 00:00:34.535
and it goes by the name Batman.

00:00:34.618 --> 00:00:37.621
NARRATOR: And an agent of chaos
makes her deadly debut.

00:00:37.704 --> 00:00:39.248
HARLEY QUINN:
I'm Harleen Quinzel.

00:00:39.331 --> 00:00:40.958
I think I used to be a doctor?

00:00:41.083 --> 00:00:42.543
NARRATOR: Hang on
to your headphones

00:00:42.626 --> 00:00:46.463
and tune in for ten
all-new explosive episodes.

00:00:46.547 --> 00:00:50.467
Stream every episode of DC's
Batman: The Audio Adventures

00:00:50.551 --> 00:00:54.263
season two on HBO Max
starting October 7th.

00:00:54.346 --> 00:00:56.108
And don't miss the seven-issue

00:00:56.162 --> 00:00:59.101
Batman: The Audio Adventures
comic book series

00:00:59.184 --> 00:01:00.769
by the writer
